// SOURCE: examples/cli/main.vl
// ARGS: --help
// EXPECT: cli 0.25
// EXPECT: prints its words, one a line
// EXPECT:
// EXPECT: usage: cli [options] <word>...
// EXPECT:
// EXPECT: arguments:
// EXPECT:   <word>...            the words
// EXPECT:
// EXPECT: options:
// EXPECT:   -v, --verbose        also print the options (-vv: the count too)
// EXPECT:   -p, --prefix <TEXT>  printed before each word [default: --]
// EXPECT:   -n, --times <N>      print the words N times [default: 1]
// EXPECT:   -h, --help           print this help
// EXPECT:   -V, --version        print the version
